      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "According to the Bible, the Beatitudes were part of Jesus’ Sermon on the Mound.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "716731_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "There’s like, 8 of ‘em I think. Nine counting the drum solo.",
